// MM32F031F6U6 — minimal Renode platform for the VanMoof shifterboot loader.
//
// shifterboot owns the first 6 KB of flash and the CPU resets straight into its
// vector table at flash 0x08000000 (no VanMoof image header — that belongs to the
// application). It validates the two image slots (slot 1 = OTA staging @ 0x08001800,
// slot 2 = active image @ 0x08004800), boots a valid image via boot_app, and when
// neither slot validates stays resident as a Modbus RTU OTA server on USART1
// (this module answers as slave 0x20).
//
// The MindMotion HAL leaves (USART/GPIO/RCC/NVIC/CRC config) are satisfied by the
// firmware's own weak fallbacks in src/hal_stubs.S, so no UART/GPIO peripheral
// models are needed here. The clock/flash/CRC status registers the loader polls
// directly (set_sysclock_to_48m, image_verify_crc) are unmodelled — Renode reads
// them back as 0 and warns, never faults — except the two RCC ready bits the
// boot clock bring-up spins on, which the suite supplies via `sysbus Tag`.
// This part is Cortex-M0 (no VTOR): the loader runs with its vectors at flash base.

cpu: CPU.CortexM @ sysbus
    cpuType: "cortex-m0"
    nvic: nvic

nvic: IRQControllers.NVIC @ sysbus 0xE000E000
    systickFrequency: 48000000
    IRQ -> cpu@0

// 32 KB flash: loader (0x08000000) + OTA staging slot 1 (0x08001800) + active
// image slot 2 (0x08004800) + the settings page tail. Slot vector tables sit at
// slot_base + image-header size (40 B).
flash: Memory.MappedMemory @ sysbus 0x08000000
    size: 0x8000

// 4 KB SRAM (initial SP _estack = 0x200006F8). Holds the loader's Modbus RX
// accumulator (0x200000C4 / index 0x20000014), the OTA scratch, and the suite's
// leaf-call scratch buffer high in the bank.
sram: Memory.MappedMemory @ sysbus 0x20000000
    size: 0x1000
